WEBVTT

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.730
Hello, Kuchiki-sempai.

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:57.090
<b>The Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture</b>

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:57.090
<b>Welcome to Genshiken!</b>

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:55.260
Did you enjoy Comic Festival, everyone?

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.090
It was great!

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.540
We got to cosplay, buy stuff, and sell stuff!

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:03.810
I guess maybe we got to enjoy everything 
that Comic Festival has to offer.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.330
I'm glad to hear it.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:08.900
I didn't get to help at all this time.

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:11.340
But this is about the time

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.560
when you realize which doujinshi you 
forgot to buy, and get depressed, right?

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.670
We didn't get to pick up any 
doujinshi about swimming, did we? {Meaning of this line is unclear, looks like they picked "swimming" as a genre at the last second.}{It's a reference to Free!, KyoAni's hilariously controversial fujoshi-bait anime about cute boys doing cute swimming things.}

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.380
How was it for you, Hato-kun?

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:22.310
It was lots of fun, of course.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:23.790
I see.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:29.080
Madarame-sempai is a bottom!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.570
Um, excuse me.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:36.210
I've got some shopping to do 
today, so I'll be leaving early.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.100
Huh? Okay.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.680
Shout "Moe!" Beyond the Event Horizon

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:47.340
She said that in front of everybody?

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.410
That Madarame-san was a total bottom?

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.390
Hato-kun said that?

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.470
She did.

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:59.020
It felt like she just couldn't watch 
what Angela was doing to Madarame-san.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:00.570
Angela? What?

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.120
Ignore them.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:07.210
Wow... So people will just say that sort 
of thing now? Is that really a good idea?

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:10.970
I told Sasahara-san about Sasa x Mada 
because I didn't have a choice, but...

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.470
I couldn't say that to Madarame-san.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:18.150
Isn't this kind of like what happened 
when you were in middle school?

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.010
Having him find out himself?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:24.930
Is there any advice you 
could give to Hato-kun?

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:31.100
No. I got the bad ending.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:38.550
You should show them all the 
Sasa x Mada manga you drew.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.140
W-Why?

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:45.450
What's important right now is to make 
sure Hato doesn't feel alone.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.870
Outside of Genshiken, Hato is always alone.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:58.380
Madarame was her only male friend.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:02.550
So right now we need to 
make sure she remembers

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:08.610
that we're just like her.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:18.980
Lately he's always over there. He 
never comes into the club room.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.950
He's probably got his own 
problems with things.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.210
Anyway, so...

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:32.290
I've been in love with the idea of Sasa x Mada
 for long enough to draw all these,

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:36.500
so you could say Madarame-san being a total 
bottom is the unanimous opinion of Genshiken!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:40.460
Wow, these are good! They look just 
like the real thing! And so hot!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:44.380
I seriously respect that she drew 
these about her own boyfriend!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.890
So can I borrow these or copy them?

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:54.100
S-So Hato-kun! Don't be depressed, we all--

00:04:55.970 --> 00:05:00.380
It's okay to draw this. It's okay...

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.780
...to draw this!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.320
It's okay to draw this!

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:05.570
Huh?

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.820
I've always wanted to 
draw something like this!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.620
Something serious and hardcore, 
and based off of real people.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.090
I wasn't sure about the idea of 
drawing people I knew, but...

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:19.000
Way to go, sempai! It's okay 
to draw this, isn't it?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.420
Hey, wait! Did we flip 
some kind of weird switch?

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:27.920
I'll draw it, then! The fantasy 
I've always wanted to draw!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.560
Madarame-sempai as a total bottom!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.760
Hello there.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.320
Madarame-san? What's wrong?

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:38.230
Nothing, really.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.880
Sue told me to come as 
soon as I was off work.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.420
Sue? Why?

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.490
I thought we could get 
everything worked out at once.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.590
But why is Madarame here so early?

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.100
What happened to his job?

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:52.170
Um, I'm sorry about what happened 
at Comic Festival. I'm really sorry!

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:55.160
Um, let's just both forget it.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.720
No, I can't.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.350
Um...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.580
I'm sorry. May I apologize too?

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.490
About what?

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:10.760
To be honest, all the freshmen 
think you're a bottom.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.180
Yajima-san!

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:13.180
I see...

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:16.690
Yes, since we first saw you in spring.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:20.570
We did all say that you 
were definitely a bottom.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:25.260
And Hato even said 
Hato x Mada was a possibility.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:31.290
That's just how rotten we are.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.630
So you can just ignore what we say.

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:38.750
Just write it off as a bad 
experience and forget it.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:46.830
Kuchiki-kun?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.630
I've finally made my decision.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.890
Hato-chin... if you, my beautiful 
Hato-chin, wish it...

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:58.270
I will be your top!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.060
Kuchi x Mada!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.530
Show me...

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.450
...your ass!

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.200
Your ass!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.660
Your ass! Your ass!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.250
Run, sempai! Quickly!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.440
I don't think we can help you here.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.620
Yes.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:56.040
Um, when someone goes unconscious from a choke 
hold, it's important to wake them up quickly.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.410
What should we do?

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.700
Do it now!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.420
Does this count as a success?

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.760
This is clearly a failure.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:10.220
I told you, you have to decide that yourself.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:12.910
I'm on your side whichever you pick.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.470
Listen to what people have to 
say, but you don't have to do it.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:19.960
Is it my fault that you can't 
stick up for yourself, maybe?

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.370
Then I've got an idea.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:33.560
What, it's just Yaji-san?

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.070
No, no, no, wait.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:40.560
Why did you come here, yell at me, then give 
me a nickname right from Yajikita Douchuuki?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.750
I'm only here for Madarame.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.290
What's with him?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:49.000
I think he's started to 
like it when I choke him.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.710
Please do it to me again!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.840
Oh, he's a pervert.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.840
Of course, I refused, and then...

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:02.520
He said, "If I attack Madarame-sempai 
again, will you choke me?"

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.570
What is wrong with him?

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.110
Hi there.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:12.260
There you are. See, told 
you this was the place.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.030
Yeah, sempai.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:18.030
This is the guy who asked 
about Hato that time.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:23.080
Oh no. Kuchiki-sempai, make 
yourself useful for once!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.610
Hey!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.290
You really are worthless.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.690
Hey, question for you. I don't 
see you around school often.

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.730
Are you maybe not a student here?

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:36.630
No, um, well...

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.230
Is this my fault?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.510
At a time when Ogiue-sempai, 
Ohno-sempai, and Sue are all gone,

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:47.360
normals are in here trying to pick 
up girls.This is an emergency!

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.060
I need to do something.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.070
Don't be so nervous.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.660
I...

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:58.570
Hey, now. You don't look 
like you belong in here.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:02.890
Who is that?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.040
Yoshitake?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.120
This is an otaku circle with 
a long and proud history.

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.370
It's no place for normal guys.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.240
Huh? Are we the bad guys here?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.670
Yeah, sempai.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.150
Are you Yoshitake-san's brother?

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:22.970
Yeah.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:23.990
Hi there.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:27.710
Yoshitake Rihito. A sophomore at Wasuda 
University, and a year older than me. {Note that there is a Waseda university IRL. This is Wasuda.}

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.210
My brother's come to hang out with us!

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:35.040
Her brother's pretty 
amazing,isn't he, Yajima-san?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.250
Yeah, he is.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:40.340
Better than a sempai who 
can't even scare people off.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:41.560
Kabincho!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.380
He ran off.

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:50.750
Don't worry about it, onii-chan.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.790
Yajima-san!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.490
Shut up! It bothers you too, right?

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:56.720
You don't have to turn 
your head away, though.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:58.010
Leave me alone.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.210
And actually,

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.530
I can't even stand to look over there!

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:06.470
Dang it! I always ignore the cute guys.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.220
His timing was just too perfect!

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.930
Are you really an otaku? You don't look it.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:16.360
No, I'm... hmm. I suppose 
my favorite genre is shota?

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.200
We don't need any comments 
like that, onii-chan.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:23.070
I guess if he's Yoshitake's 
brother, he can't be normal.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:27.080
But you don't look much like 
an otaku either, Hato-san.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.720
Those cute clothes really work on you.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.320
Thank you.

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:37.790
No, I'm happy for the compliment, 
but does he know I'm a guy?

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:41.400
"Don't tell him"?

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:45.220
No, I suppose she means 
she hasn't told him yet.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.140
Either way, it's best not to talk about it.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.140
Oh no, did she realize I was looking at him?

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:56.900
She has to know her brother 
is popular with girls.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.780
I bet she's got a really good 
sense for when girls like him.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:04.050
Something seems kind of 
wrong about these two.

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:09.520
Yajima-san, thanks for always 
hanging out with my sister.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.580
I-It's okay.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.410
She showed me your drawing 
in the... magazine, I think?

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:19.460
It was very much a student's work, but I 
think you may have the greatest potential here.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.810
No, no way.

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:24.970
Aren't you just being really 
polite about saying it sucked?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.810
Have more faith in yourself!

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.290
I-I can't look at him.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:32.310
Now then, you two, since my brother 
is here, why don't we go drinking?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.530
You can come to my place today.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.260
Sure.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:38.650
I guess I could go.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.480
Alright, let's go!

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.970
Don't worry, I'm here.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.070
Okay.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.530
Hold on a second.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.580
What? You're bothering me.

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:54.170
My name is Mikami. I'm from the 
Circle Leadership Committee.

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:56.920
I'd like to ask you some questions.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.650
Leadership?

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:01.120
We've received some complaints

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:06.440
about a woman who is attending circle meetings, 
but may not be student at this university.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:11.360
Given her physical description, and that 
you appear to be active with Genshiken,

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.680
I thought it might be you.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:17.070
I apologize if I'm incorrect.

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:20.820
But I need to check, just to make sure.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.360
First, are you a student at this university?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.570
I won't know unless you tell me.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:30.970
What's going on today?

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:33.040
There's too many guys around here!

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:35.890
Mikami-sempai, I told you I'd look into her!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.250
Just let me handle this.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:41.260
Harima, you say that, butyou 
haven't done anything.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:43.210
That's why I'm asking now.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.730
I'll ask her. I'll ask her!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:48.650
You guys get back to the club room.

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:52.640
Fine. You're pushy, you know that?

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.640
<b>Circle Leadership Committee</b>

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.660
You're with the Leadership Committee?

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.120
Yeah, I guess.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.390
Why didn't you say something?

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:04.190
He wasn't trying to pick up girls, after all?

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:08.030
Well, if I told you,

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:12.380
and then I tried to hit on her, 
Mikami-san would get pissed!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.300
No, he totally was.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:19.300
Oh well. First, give me your name.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.410
Idiot.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.460
Harima-san, was it?

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.630
Y-Yes?

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.030
If I leave him like this, he's going to die.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:09.770
May I go now, so I can try to wake him up?

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.180
Yes.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.640
Your younger sister?

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.480
Yes. That's right.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:20.030
My real name is Yoshitake Risa. I'm an 
eighteen year old high school senior.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:22.100
I'm a girl.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.650
And on the school basketball team!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.150
So people always mistake her for a guy.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:29.370
I told her this was a bad idea.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:31.180
I wanted to see how long it'd take 
before anyone here figured it out.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.570
Well? Had you going, didn't we?

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:34.620
Not at all.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.840
But it's true that she likes shota.

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:37.890
Shut up.

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.260
Damn it.

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:42.210
She's not your year-older brother, 
she's your year-younger sister?

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.410
Who could tell?

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.040
So we did fool you!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.800
No, I'm two years younger.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.170
Ow.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.130
Her sister is two years younger 
and in high school?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.900
Which means you weren't just born first.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.870
Yeah. I actually took a year off 
between high school and college.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.610
And since I was born in April, I've 
been twenty years old for a while now.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:06.320
That's not worth hiding. 
Lots of people do that.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.770
But...

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.050
I suppose I let it go on too long,

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:13.400
but you really can't keep 
dragging out the same joke.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:16.570
Yes. You're absolutely correct, Hato-chin.

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:19.690
I didn't want to feel like there 
was any distance between us.

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:23.030
And most people wouldn't believe 
I looked like twenty, you know?

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:25.000
Honestly, it's embarrassing.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.750
Idiot. Who cares?

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.600
Yajimacchi.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:33.830
So today, you're paying.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.780
The sin of messing with the few 
romantic feelings I have left

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:39.390
should be punished by death, you know.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.220
Even a rotten girl has 
her moments of weakness.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.400
Right.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.110
I wish you could've seen 
the rest of the club.

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.590
It's fine.

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:55.120
If they saw me, I'd probably 
have to join the club.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:57.950
That's more of a sports thing. 
It wouldn't happen here.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:02.290
But you're really good at 
basketball, right? Why quit?

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.250
Look at how white it is?

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:07.310
Risa-san is a fan of 
Kamiyama Seitarou, right?

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:09.430
N-No.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.540
You look at the TV whenever he's on.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:14.480
Well, he's what got her into shota.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:19.130
You picked a rough time to be into 3D shota. {I'm not sure why and I'm scared to google it.  Probably legal reasons?}{I think this a reference to the Tokyo decency legislation that's driven Ken Akamatsu into a shrieking fury.}

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.980
Oh, I mostly collect 2D stuff...

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:26.100
And Kamiyama-kun's in middle school already.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:29.620
I'm sure he's not nice and smooth anymore!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:33.120
What were we talking about?

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.170
Never mind.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.650
Well, it's not that she 
wants to quit basketball.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.580
If she really didn't like it, she 
would've quit a long time ago.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.130
But between games and training camps,

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:46.800
she's never gotten to go to a Comic 
Festival, or an "only event". {What only is a reference to is unclear.}{Seems to be a reference to オンリー同人誌即売会, or a doujin sales convention focusing on a single pairing, character, or source work.}

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.840
Either way, she needs to make 
her own decision about it.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:55.910
But I thought coming to the club might help.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.200
So was there a reason why you 
made her pretend to be a guy?

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.220
Of course not.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:05.120
Well? Anything else you want to see?

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.890
Actually...

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:12.070
I'd like to see Hato-san as a guy, I think.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.740
W-Why?

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:19.710
I want to know how much 
effort you put into this

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:22.970
just so you can hang out 
with the rotten girls.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:26.060
That sounds like something 
a sports player might think.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.580
Yeah.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.440
But it's not happening.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:38.130
It was months before we got 
to see Hato without makeup.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.710
She can't show it to you 
the first day you meet her.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.160
Anyway, that aside...

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.010
Hey, wait!

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.660
What do you think, Hato-chan?

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:50.950
I think it could be really inspiring for her, 
since she never puts in any effort herself.

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:56.280
It's the perfect chance to 
get a new point of view.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.840
So as her sister, I'd 
appreciate it if you could.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.910
I guess.

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:04.160
Perhaps some other time.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.160
Non non! Right now.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.480
You've got your change of 
clothes and makeup, right?

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.540
But in someone else's house...

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.290
The bathroom's right over there.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.170
Get going.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.260
Hey, don't force her.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:25.390
I'll go take a shower then.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:29.380
Go on. Take your time and transform.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.200
Now then...

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:34.560
No.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.860
Risa?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.730
I'm sorry, Yajimacchi-san, I have 
to do whatever my sister says!

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:44.360
That's right! If you don't want me 
to share your secrets, do what I say!

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.620
Are you serious, Yoshitake?

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.290
Totes serious!

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:50.760
So creepy...

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:55.430
Yajimacchi, have you resolved 
your doubts about Hato-chan?

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:59.260
Like what it looks like, 
or... what it looks like?

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.680
Or what it looks like?!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:05.850
You did try to look up her skirt.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.770
Forget that!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.540
Really?

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:13.150
A rotten girl's got a right to her fantasies, 
but she needs something to fantasize about.

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:13.560
What--

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:18.410
And right beyond this door 
is the ultimate ingredient!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:26.990
Don't underestimate a fat 
chick's muscles, Yoshitake!

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.730
Yajimacchi?

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:47.300
Sorry!

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:58.120
They didn't see it?

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:00.820
Just me? And it was real? And...

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.160
Silk--

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.160
Silk--

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.470
S-Silky-smooth.

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:07.030
Silky-smooth!

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:11.290
What was silky-smooth?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:15.110
Lose your memories!

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:18.880
Hato never did come out of the bathroom,

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.650
so we were forced to end for the day.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:27.160
P.S. Yoshitake's little sister decided to 
take the entrance exam for Shiiou University.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.580
From the diary of Yajima Mirei.

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.740
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.740
Yoshitake-san, is it true that 
your sister is a hot guy?

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:15.210
It's true. Here, look.

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:17.410
Why didn't you call me?

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:19.640
Think of the cosplay possibilities!

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:20.980
With her dressed as a guy?

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:23.840
Like that character or this 
character... Tanaka-san!

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:25.870
She might be coming to our school next year.

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:28.070
We've got Hato-kun so we can do 
male and female crossdressing!

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:30.800
They can complement each other!

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.850
There's all kinds of possibilities!

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:33.220
I can't wait!

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:36.720
Um, won't you be graduating 
next year, Ohno-sempai?

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.060
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second Generation</i>:
 KOIBANA3!
